|title=His first major acting '''credit''' came in 1957 British gangster film No Road Back.
|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230223020345/https://www.scotsman.com/arts-and-culture/film-and-tv/sean-connery-obituary-delivering-milk-fountainbridge-definitive-james-bond-3021133
|archivedate=23 February 2023
}}
# {{lb|en|television|film|usually|in the plural}} Written [[title]]s and other information about the TV program or movie shown at the beginning and/or end of the TV program or movie.
