#* {{quote-book|en|year=2016|author=A.K. Brown|title=Jumpstart|series=Champagne Universe Series: Book 1|page=19|passage="First the Patrons wipe-out our home world, now you blow any chance of us making any '''credits'''," Kane said in his gruff sinking voice.}}
