===Etymology 1===
[[File:Rho Ophiucus Widefield.jpg|thumb|A [[photograph#Noun|photograph]] of a [[portion#Noun|portion]] of the cosmos ''({{senseno|en|universe}})''.]]

{{root|en|ine-pro|*ḱens-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|cossmos|t=the universe; the world}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=cosmōs|pos=n|id=MED9882}}</ref> borrowed from {{der|en|grc|κόσμος|t=order; universe; the earth, the world; decoration, ornament}},<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=4934253657|date=July 2023|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|alt=cosmos{{sup|1}}|pos=n}}</ref> ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*ḱens-|t=to announce, proclaim; to put in order}}.

The {{glossary|plural}} form {{m|en|cosmoi}} is a {{lbor|en|grc|κόσμοι|nocap=1|nocat=1}}.

